      "explanation": "Aniline (P) is treated with NaNO<sub>2</sub> and HCl in cold condition to form benzene diazonium chloride. The process of conversion of primary aromatic amines into its diazonium salt is called diazotisation. <br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdn7n0c/1093da16-fc8c-4ca0-b4d8-6acddceb7c5e/d9c73ed0-fe04-11eb-8b89-b9bac1d0e387/file-1ksdn7n0d-320w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdn7n0c/1093da16-fc8c-4ca0-b4d8-6acddceb7c5e/d9c73ed0-fe04-11eb-8b89-b9bac1d0e387/file-1ksdn7n0d-500w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdn7n0c/1093da16-fc8c-4ca0-b4d8-6acddceb7c5e/d9c73ed0-fe04-11eb-8b89-b9bac1d0e387/file-1ksdn7n0d-680w.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdn7n0c/1093da16-fc8c-4ca0-b4d8-6acddceb7c5e/d9c73ed0-fe04-11eb-8b89-b9bac1d0e387/file-1ksdn7n0d.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2020 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 36 English Explanation 1\"></picture> <br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.296ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 573 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-naphthol couples with phenyldiazonium electrophile to produce an intense orange-red dye (Q) as major product.<br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksdn85bu/7e6707f8-bf4d-47e0-8732-f07d829f0301/e7edd5a0-fe04-11eb-ad81-9d3a1298e